      <p class="mb-6">
        Keep these essential factors in mind when choosing your live streaming directory:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-4 mb-8">
        <li><strong>Redundancy:</strong> Multiple active backup feeds for every matchup</li>
        <li><strong>Responsiveness:</strong> A layout that scales perfectly on smart devices</li>
